  "plot_summary": "[ASSET: left | VillainContinued | width=15%] The <b>Special Announcements Section</b> of [LINK:1964:ASM_12|ASM #12|2027-06-02] poses the interesting question about whether it is okay with readers if they use a villain for more than one story.&nbsp; This sounds very much like asking permission to do continued stories.\n\n[ASSET: right | MoreLettersPages | width=12%] That same section of [LINK:1964:FF_26|FF #26|2027-06-05] featured this bit of information (see image to the right), that Letters Pages are soon coming to both <i>Avengers</i> and <i>X-Men</i> (and Sgt. Fury as well, though I don't review those issues, [PAGE: meanwhile | as detailed here]).",
